35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The car is often dirty and empty when I get it. That is unacceptable.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,The diary shows Saturdays are triple the work of Tuesdays. It is uneven.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The fixed costs are high, and short runs damage the car more.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Other groups failed because they had to ask favours constantly.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Two people bought most of the fuel. The split is very lopsided.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, if two people drive most, why do I pay the same?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, because the fixed costs are shared, but the wear is not.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, the mechanic said short runs eat the brakes. That is a hidden cost.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, so we need a system that doesn't feel like asking for a favour.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, a booking system might stop the favour-asking.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I need the car to be ready. A fixed day might help me plan.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,A calendar would let me see the load before I commit.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,A primary keeper might handle the maintenance better.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I am worried about the checking figures part. It felt accusatory.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I agree with Takumi. We need a neutral way to track it.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
